        "bodyEn": "The subject side is organised into streams that mirror common degree groups — for instance medical/biological, engineering/technical, economics, and humanities. Each stream teaches a tailored set of foundation subjects in the teaching language.\n\nA medical or biological stream typically covers biology, chemistry, and sometimes physics; an engineering stream covers mathematics, physics, and computing basics; an economics stream covers mathematics and introductory economics; a humanities stream focuses on language, history of the field, and social-science basics. The exact subject combinations are set by each university."
