      "bodyEn": "The other direction also has an official process: verifying a degree issued by a Saudi institution — for example, confirming its authenticity when you present it to an employer or another institution. Verification of Saudi qualifications is handled through official channels, including the Ministry of Education's official qualification-verification e-service.\n\nWhether you are a graduate of a Saudi university or someone needing to confirm a Saudi qualification, use the official verification channels rather than informal confirmation. This protects against forged or misrepresented documents and ensures the confirmation is authoritative. Confirm the current verification steps on the official source."
