      "bodyEn": "Fintech — financial technology — sits between finance and computing. Where a general finance degree teaches you how money is raised, invested and managed, a fintech specialisation adds the technology layer: how digital systems move payments, deliver banking, analyse financial data and meet regulatory requirements.\n\nIn the Gulf, fintech appears in several forms: as a specialisation or concentration inside a finance or business degree, as a track within a computer-science or information-systems degree, and at postgraduate level as a dedicated master's. The shape varies by university, so read the official programme page to see whether a course leans more toward finance or more toward computing."
