      "headingEn": "What graduates work on",
      "bodyEn": "Fintech graduates move toward roles that combine financial knowledge with technology — areas such as digital banking and payments, financial data and analytics, product and project work in financial services, and compliance technology. Some pair the degree with a professional certification later.\n\nNo programme guarantees a role, a salary or entry into a particular employer. Outcomes depend on your skills, the qualifications you build and the wider market. Use this as a sense of direction, not a promise."
