      "questionEn": "Is the CBSE board accepted by universities in the Gulf?",
      "answerEn": "CBSE certificates are widely held and routinely assessed by Gulf universities. Acceptance depends on meeting the programme's grade and subject requirements, and a foreign certificate may need equivalency or attestation. Confirm the exact rule on the official university or ministry page for your destination country."
