      "questionEn": "What is the difference between credit transfer and RPL?",
      "answerEn": "Credit transfer recognises formal study you have already completed; recognition of prior learning (RPL) recognises skills and knowledge from work or experience against parts of a qualification, where the provider offers it. Both require evidence and an institutional assessment."
