      "answerEn": "The Departing Australia Superannuation Payment lets eligible temporary-visa holders apply to receive their accumulated super after they leave Australia permanently and their visa has ceased. Tax is withheld at a government-set rate. Check the current eligibility and process on the official ATO source."
