      "headingEn": "Document checklist and verification",
      "bodyEn": "Prepare your documents early and confirm the exact list with your university, because requirements differ. Translations and legalisation (apostille or embassy legalisation) often take time.\n\nThis is general information, not immigration or admissions advice. Eligibility rules, the schooling requirement, and accepted certificates change between years and universities — verify everything on the official CIMEA, your Italian embassy/consulate (via studyinitaly.esteri.it), Universitaly, and university websites before relying on it.",
