      "bodyEn": "English-taught political science and IR degrees are widely available, especially at master's level, and notably in the Netherlands, the Nordic countries, and at international-track programmes in France, Germany and Italy.\n\nDo not rely on a memorised list. Use the official national study portals to filter by subject and by language of instruction: Study in NL (Nuffic) for the Netherlands, University Admissions for Sweden, Campus France for France, the DAAD database for Germany, and Universitaly for Italy. Then confirm the language and content on the individual university's own programme page, since offerings are added and withdrawn each cycle."
