      "questionEn": "Is there one EU Blue Card salary threshold for the whole EU?",
      "answerEn": "No. The Blue Card comes from an EU directive (Directive (EU) 2021/1883), but each participating member state sets its own minimum gross-salary threshold under national law and updates it over time. The figure that matters is the one in force in the country where you will work. Verify it on that country's official immigration source."
