      "bodyEn": "While you hold a Blue Card, changing your job or employer can carry conditions — especially early in the permit's life. National rules may require you to notify the authority or obtain fresh approval before, or when, you change employer or move to a substantially different role, particularly within an initial period.\n\nBecause a Blue Card is tied to a qualifying high-skilled job meeting the salary threshold, a new role must still satisfy those conditions. The notification or approval requirements and any initial restricted period are set nationally and change, so check what applies in the country that issued your card before you switch.",
