      "questionEn": "I'm finishing Class 12 in India — am I a 101 or a 105 applicant?",
      "answerEn": "You are a 105 (Group B) applicant. The 101 / Group A stream is only for students currently in the Ontario high-school system. Studying in India's school system puts you in the 105 stream, which is the standard route for international applicants. Confirm on the OUAC's 'Am I a 101 or 105?' page."
