      "questionEn": "How many Ontario programs should I apply to?",
      "answerEn": "There is no official correct number. Build a balanced list of programs you would genuinely attend, mixing reach, match and safer options, and weigh it against the per-choice fee. Quality of fit beats quantity. Check the current fees on the OUAC Fees page before adding choices."
