      "questionEn": "Should every choice be at a different university?",
      "answerEn": "Not necessarily — you can choose more than one program at the same university, and sometimes that makes sense. The goal is a balanced set of programs you genuinely want, across the reach, match and safe tiers, rather than spreading choices for its own sake."
