      "bodyEn": "EducationPlannerBC (EPBC) is British Columbia's official online application service for post-secondary education. From a single account you can research programs and submit applications to many participating BC public universities, colleges and institutes — including the University of British Columbia (UBC), Simon Fraser University (SFU), the University of Victoria (UVic) and others.\n\nNot every BC institution uses EPBC for every program, and some apply their own supplementary application or portal on top of it. Always confirm on each institution's official admissions page whether you apply through EducationPlannerBC, the institution's own system, or both, before you start.",
