      "bodyEn": "Quebec universities generally distinguish between several categories of student. The exact labels and structure can vary by institution and over time, but the broad tiers are well established.\n\nAs an international student, you will normally pay the international tier unless a specific agreement reduces it. Out-of-province Canadian students (those from other provinces) are typically treated differently from both Quebec residents and international students.",
