      "questionEn": "Do Canadian universities prefer the IB or A-Levels?",
      "answerEn": "Neither is universally preferred. Canadian universities have established admission pathways for both, and assess each on its own terms. Choose based on your school's offering and your program's prerequisites, and verify requirements on each university's official page."
