      "questionEn": "What's the difference between GCKey and a Sign-In Partner?",
      "answerEn": "GCKey is a government-issued username and password; a Sign-In Partner lets you log in using a participating Canadian bank's online credentials. Most students applying from abroad use GCKey. Always sign in the same way you registered."
