      "headingEn": "Using the REF wisely in your decision",
      "bodyEn": "Treat the REF as one strong input, not the whole decision. Look up your subject area at each shortlisted university, then combine that with official course content, graduate outcomes, location, cost and support to judge overall fit.\n\nRemember the results reflect a past assessment period and the institution as a whole within each subject grouping, so they will not capture every recent change. Use the official REF portal for the data and the university's own pages for the latest picture.",
