      "questionEn": "How can I tell if a UK or Irish psychology course is accredited?",
      "answerEn": "Use the official accredited-course search or list on the BPS website (UK) or the PSI website (Ireland), confirm the exact course title and any specified pathway, and ask the university to confirm the status in writing. Re-check before you finalise your application."
