      "headingEn": "Common benefits honors colleges offer",
      "bodyEn": "While details vary, honors colleges often advertise a set of benefits designed to give a smaller, more personal experience inside a big university. These can make a large public university feel more intimate.\n\nNot every honors college offers every benefit, and some perks have eligibility conditions. Read each program's official description carefully so your expectations match what that specific honors college actually provides.",
