      "questionEn": "What is the difference between biomedical engineering and biomedical science?",
      "answerEn": "Biomedical engineering centers on engineering design and building devices, instruments and systems for healthcare, while biomedical science focuses on studying biology and disease. BME carries a heavier engineering and math load."
