      "headingEn": "Balancing the creative and academic file",
      "bodyEn": "Even at portfolio-heavy programs, the academic application — transcript, essays, recommendations and any required tests — still counts. Test and supplement policies vary by school and year, so check each program's current requirements.\n\nGive yourself enough lead time to make and revise creative work; strong reels and writing rarely come together at the last minute. Plan backward from each program's official deadline."
