      "questionEn": "What is SlideRoom and do all colleges use it?",
      "answerEn": "SlideRoom is a platform many US colleges use to collect creative supplements such as portfolios and audition media, and it integrates with the Common App. Not every college uses it — some have their own portals or hold auditions directly. Confirm the submission method on each program's official page."
