      "headingEn": "Mistake 5: Tone and Approach Errors",
      "bodyEn": "Tone slips can undercut an otherwise good essay: trying too hard to impress, being overly negative or complaining, oversharing, or writing what you think admissions 'wants' instead of what's true. Aim for an honest, reflective, respectful voice.",
