      "headingEn": "Use official channels only",
      "bodyEn": "Apply through the university's official international-admissions channel or the Government of India's Study in India programme. No agent can guarantee a university seat in India — admission depends on official eligibility and the published process. Be cautious of guaranteed-admission offers and verify every detail on the official website."
