      "bodyEn": "Be cautious of third parties who quote fees, promise discounts, or guarantee a seat in exchange for payment — no one can guarantee admission, and fee figures from unofficial sources may be inaccurate or out of date. Always cross-check any amount against the institution's official website or admissions office.\n\nFor general programme and institution information, the Government of India's Study in India portal and the relevant regulators (such as the UGC and AICTE for higher-education and technical programmes) can help you identify recognised institutions, but the binding fee figures are the ones the institution itself publishes. This is general information, not financial advice."
