      "questionEn": "Where can I learn IoT and embedded systems officially?",
      "answerEn": "Free official courses are available on NPTEL and SWAYAM (Ministry of Education), and NIELIT (under MeitY) runs electronics and IoT-related courses. Check current details and any fees on the official websites before enrolling."
