      "questionEn": "Which entrance exams are used for LLM admission?",
      "answerEn": "CLAT-PG (Consortium of National Law Universities) is widely used by NLUs, NLU Delhi conducts AILET, and other universities may use CUET-PG or their own tests. Check the official websites for the current pattern, dates, and participating universities."
