      "bodyEn": "After registration you fill and lock your choices: you select college-and-branch combinations from those you are eligible for and arrange them strictly in order of preference. The seat you most want goes at the top.\n\nThe allotment logic descends your list and stops at the best seat your rank, category and seat availability allow, so ordering is decisive. Fill enough realistic choices to avoid going unallotted, but never rank a seat above another you would actually prefer.\n\nOnce arranged, you lock the list. Locked choices are what the system uses, so review them before the window closes. UPTAC may provide guidance or a preview to help you gauge outcomes — treat any such preview as indicative, not a promise."
