      "answerEn": "OJEE is a single-window process for many Odisha professional courses — B.Pharm and B.CAT, lateral entry into B.Tech and B.Pharm, and postgraduate courses like MBA, MCA, M.Tech, M.Arch, M.Plan, M.Pharm, Integrated MBA and M.Sc., plus nursing. It also runs the state counselling for some NEET/JEE-based seats. Check the exact list for the current year on ojee.nic.in.",
