      "headingEn": "What NIPER JEE is",
      "bodyEn": "The NIPER Joint Entrance Examination (NIPER JEE) is the admission test for the National Institutes of Pharmaceutical Education and Research (NIPERs) — a group of institutes of national importance dedicated to advanced pharmaceutical education and research, often described informally as the 'IIT of pharma'.\n\nNIPER JEE is an institute-specific, research-oriented entrance: it admits candidates to postgraduate and doctoral programmes at the NIPERs, rather than being a general M.Pharm test used by universities across the country. If your goal is a research-focused pharmaceutical education at a NIPER, this is the exam you sit.",
