  "descriptionEn": "An evergreen guide to the MAH MBA/MMS CET — Maharashtra's state MBA/MMS entrance for JBIMS, SIMSREE, PUMBA and hundreds of institutes. Eligibility, pattern, CAP counselling and prep, with volatile figures deferred to the official CET Cell.",
