      "questionEn": "What are the biggest red flags of a fake university?",
      "answerEn": "Not appearing on recognised lists, offering distance/online degrees in prohibited professional fields, promising unusually fast or 'lifetime valid' degrees, guaranteeing admission, pressuring quick payment, and using names that closely imitate well-known institutions."
