      "answerEn": "There is no single national format. A short, factual declaration with your name, last exam and year, the gap period, an honest reason, and a statement that you were not enrolled elsewhere is the common pattern. Because wording and stamp-paper rules differ, follow the format specified by your college or counselling body's official instructions."
