  "titleEn": "How to Become a Psychiatrist in India",
  "descriptionEn": "The medical route to psychiatry in India — MBBS via NEET-UG, then MD or DNB in Psychiatry via NEET-PG under the National Medical Commission, plus how a psychiatrist differs from a psychologist.",
