  "descriptionEn": "How Bhutanese students study in India — the distinct Bhutan-India entry arrangement, the Bhutan-specific Nehru-Wangchuck Scholarship and Government of India slots, the Royal Government of Bhutan / Embassy of India channels, and admission routes. General information, not immigration advice.",
  "readMinutes": 8,
