      "questionEn": "Is it the AAT or the ART that reviews visa refusals now?",
      "answerEn": "It is the Administrative Review Tribunal (ART). The ART replaced the former Administrative Appeals Tribunal (AAT) on 14 October 2024, so eligible visa-refusal reviews are now handled by the ART. Your decision letter confirms whether your decision is reviewable and by whom.",
