      "answerEn": "Australia has several OCANZ-accredited providers (universities plus the Australian College of Optometry), while New Zealand has one — the Bachelor of Optometry at the University of Auckland. The definitive, current list is published on the OCANZ website; check it before applying, as accreditation status can change."
