      "audience": "common",
      "bodyEn": "CASPer sometimes travels with other Acuity Insights assessments. Duet is a value-alignment exercise: you indicate what you value most in a program and it is compared with what the program says it offers. Only a small number of programs use Duet, and it is more common in the United States than in Canada.\n\nSnapshot — a short one-way recorded video interview that some programs previously required — was discontinued by the provider after the 2023–2024 cycle, so you should disregard older guides that still list it as current. Because the suite evolves, treat only the official Acuity Insights site as authoritative for what exists and what a given program requires today.",
